  abilityDesc: 5 combo massive Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), hugely raises normal hit amount for 3 turns, normal attacks hit all foes
    for 3 turns, enormously boosts Atk relative to Def for 5 turns, enormously boosts
    Atk and critical hit rate for 3 turns & hugely boosts own Atk, Def, Rec for 3
    turns
